{"room_key": "room-xgoibqb8", "version": 257, "matches": [{"uid": "cbd9f127-eae8-4a5a-9235-111457362d82", "text": "渠道定义和统计维度", "note": "<div data-mind-map-text=\"[{&quot;paragraphProps&quot;:{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;paragraph&quot;,&quot;textAlign&quot;:0,&quot;lineSpacing&quot;:1.4},&quot;isComplete&quot;:false,&quot;textProps&quot;:[{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;text&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;以渠道编码和渠道名称作为&quot;,&quot;color&quot;:&quot;#1f1f1f&quot;,&quot;fontWeight&quot;:400,&quot;fontSize&quot;:14,&quot;fontFamily&quot;:&quot;\\&quot;Helvetica Neue\\&quot;, Helvetica, \\&quot;PingFang SC\\&quot;, \\&quot;Microsoft YaHei\\&quot;, \\&quot;Source Han Sans SC\\&quot;, \\&quot;Noto Sans CJK SC\\&quot;, \\&quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei\\&quot;, sans-serif&quot;,&quot;italic&quot;:false,&quot;underline&quot;:false,&quot;strike&quot;:false}]}]\">1）以渠道编码和渠道名称的唯一性来识别UNOVE全渠道销售额。</div>\n<div data-mind-map-text=\"[{&quot;paragraphProps&quot;:{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;paragraph&quot;,&quot;textAlign&quot;:0,&quot;lineSpacing&quot;:1.4},&quot;isComplete&quot;:false,&quot;textProps&quot;:[{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;text&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;以渠道编码和渠道名称作为&quot;,&quot;color&quot;:&quot;#1f1f1f&quot;,&quot;fontWeight&quot;:400,&quot;fontSize&quot;:14,&quot;fontFamily&quot;:&quot;\\&quot;Helvetica Neue\\&quot;, Helvetica, \\&quot;PingFang SC\\&quot;, \\&quot;Microsoft YaHei\\&quot;, \\&quot;Source Han Sans SC\\&quot;, \\&quot;Noto Sans CJK SC\\&quot;, \\&quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei\\&quot;, sans-serif&quot;,&quot;italic&quot;:false,&quot;underline&quot;:false,&quot;strike&quot;:false}]}]\">2）以部门为一级单位，渠道为二级单位，具体店铺为三级单位，作为渠道归纳。</div>\n<div data-mind-map-text=\"[{&quot;paragraphProps&quot;:{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;paragraph&quot;,&quot;textAlign&quot;:0,&quot;lineSpacing&quot;:1.4},&quot;isComplete&quot;:false,&quot;textProps&quot;:[{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;text&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;以渠道编码和渠道名称作为&quot;,&quot;color&quot;:&quot;#1f1f1f&quot;,&quot;fontWeight&quot;:400,&quot;fontSize&quot;:14